title = Tisséo
description = Tisséo is the brand adopted in 2002 for the transport network of Toulouse, France. Operating under the authority of the Syndicat mixte des transports en commun (SMTC), Tisséo operates two metro lines, two tramway lines, a hundred buses, and shuttle services (bus, mobibus, TAD), with a unified magnetic ticketing and RFID card system.
